sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer
    participant SPA as Web app
    participant AS as Auth server
    participant API as Orders API
    participant DB as Session store

    U->>SPA: Click "Log in"
    SPA->>AS: Redirect to /authorize (PKCE challenge)
    AS-->>U: Login page
    U->>AS: Username and password
    AS->>DB: Create session
    AS-->>SPA: Redirect with auth code
    SPA->>AS: POST /token (code + verifier)
    AS-->>SPA: Access token + refresh token (JWT)
    Note over SPA: Keep tokens in memory

    SPA->>API: GET /orders (Bearer access token)
    API->>AS: Fetch signing keys (JWKS, cached)
    API-->>SPA: 200 — orders

    Note over SPA,AS: Access token expires
    SPA->>AS: POST /token (refresh token)
    AS-->>SPA: New access token
